---The statistics about query cache usage.
---@class opensearch.CommonQueryCacheStats
---@field cache_count number The total number of entries added to the query cache across all shards assigned to the selected nodes. This number includes all current and evicted entries.
---@field cache_size number The total number of entries currently stored in the query cache across all shards assigned to the selected nodes.
---@field evictions number The total number of query cache evictions across all shards assigned to the selected nodes.
---@field hit_count number The total number of query cache hits across all shards assigned to the selected nodes.
---@field memory_size? string The human-readable amount of memory used for the query cache.
---@field memory_size_in_bytes number The total amount, in bytes, of memory used for the query cache across all shards assigned to the selected nodes.
---@field miss_count number The total number of query cache misses across all shards assigned to the selected nodes.
---@field total_count number The total number of hits and misses stored in the query cache across all shards assigned to the selected nodes.

