---@field q? string Query in the Lucene query string syntax.
---@field refresh? opensearch.CommonRefresh If `true`, OpenSearch refreshes all shards involved in the delete by query after the request completes.
---@field request_cache? boolean If `true`, the request cache is used for this request. Defaults to the index-level setting.
---@field requests_per_second? number The throttle for this request in sub-requests per second.
