---@class opensearch.KnnSearchModelsRequest
---@field _source? opensearch.KnnSearchModelsRequestSourceList Set to `true` or `false` to return the `_source` field or not, or a list of fields to return.
---@field _source_excludes? opensearch.KnnSearchModelsRequestSourceExcludesList List of fields to exclude from the returned `_source` field.
---@field _source_includes? opensearch.KnnSearchModelsRequestSourceIncludesList List of fields to extract and return from the `_source` field.
---@field allow_no_indices? boolean Whether to ignore if a wildcard indexes expression resolves into no concrete indexes. (This includes `_all` string or when no indexes have been specified).
---@field allow_partial_search_results? boolean Indicate if an error should be returned if there is a partial search failure or timeout.
---@field analyze_wildcard? boolean Specify whether wildcard and prefix queries should be analyzed.
---@field analyzer? string The analyzer to use for the query string.
---@field batched_reduce_size? number The number of shard results that should be reduced at once on the coordinating node. This value should be used as a protection mechanism to reduce the memory overhead per search request if the potential number of shards in the request can be large.
---@field ccs_minimize_roundtrips? boolean Indicates whether network round-trips should be minimized as part of cross-cluster search requests execution.
---@field default_operator? opensearch.CommonQueryDslOperator|string The default operator for query string query (AND or OR).
---@field df? string The field to use as default where no field prefix is given in the query string.
---@field docvalue_fields? opensearch.KnnSearchModelsRequestDocvalueFieldsList A comma-separated list of fields to return as the docvalue representation of a field for each hit.
